---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About Us" description="Meet the Foundation Clinic team.">

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">About us</span>
      <h1>Preventive, personalised<br>and coordinated.</h1>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-top: 16px;">Just the way healthcare should be.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-ivory">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/69c1164b3f6b0c0960887789_foundation-clinic-who15.webp" alt="Foundation Clinic" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
          <h2>Founded to change healthcare.</h2>
          <p>Foundation Clinic was founded in 2024 to address the changing nature of healthcare.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">In a world of shorter appointments, scattered records, and rotating providers, we saw a need for something more human and more effective. Healthcare that doesn't just react to symptoms, but builds long-term insight, connection, and continuity.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">We are a registered medical provider and operate with a multidisciplinary clinical team.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-sunken">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="fade-up" style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <span class="eyebrow">The team</span>
        <h2>Meet the people behind Foundation Clinic.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="team-grid">
        <div class="team-card fade-up">
          <img class="team-photo" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/67f7bb0b937aef6c9121eb7a_FoundationClinic_web_Anni-3.webp" alt="Enni Sanmark" />
          <div class="team-name">MD PhD Enni Sanmark</div>
          <div class="team-role">Chief Medical Officer</div>
          <a href="mailto:enni@foundation.clinic" class="team-email">enni@foundation.clinic</a>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.06s">
          <img class="team-photo" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/67f7bb0ca734cbad06b19b50_FoundationClinic_web_Anni-1.webp" alt="Antti Ylimutka" />
          <div class="team-name">Antti Ylimutka</div>
          <div class="team-role">Chief Executive Officer</div>
          <a href="mailto:antti@foundation.clinic" class="team-email">antti@foundation.clinic</a>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.12s">
          <img class="team-photo" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/6994da8f1b90dd85b4511d47_Fredrik.webp" alt="Fredrik Sannholm" />
          <div class="team-name">Fredrik Sannholm</div>
          <div class="team-role">Principal Engineer</div>
          <a href="mailto:fredrik@foundation.clinic" class="team-email">fredrik@foundation.clinic</a>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.18s">
          <img class="team-photo" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/67f7bb0c86cd56abba4c14bc_FoundationClinic_web_Anni.webp" alt="Anni Karjala" />
          <div class="team-name">MD PhD Anni Karjala</div>
          <div class="team-role">Head of Foundation Protocol</div>
          <a href="mailto:anni@foundation.clinic" class="team-email">anni@foundation.clinic</a>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.24s">
          <img class="team-photo" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/690ba48c4a48b7522465a82a_Eevert.webp" alt="Eevert Partinen" />
          <div class="team-name">MD Eevert Partinen</div>
          <div class="team-role">General Practitioner, Sleep Expert</div>
          <a href="mailto:eevert@foundation.clinic" class="team-email">eevert@foundation.clinic</a>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.30s">
          <img class="team-photo" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/6994db3765b46e9bd63bc049_Runo.webp" alt="Runo Pyykönen" />
          <div class="team-name">Runo Pyykönen</div>
          <div class="team-role">Head Nurse</div>
          <a href="mailto:runo@foundation.clinic" class="team-email">runo@foundation.clinic</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-ivory">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/696e0ba5c2df39adce4d2f02_tania-malrechauffe-pkMgzQfpi9Y-unsplash.jpg" alt="The clinic" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">The clinic</span>
          <h2>No waiting rooms, no rush.</h2>
          <p>At our clinic in downtown Helsinki, everything is calm, discreet, and designed for you. We're fully equipped for thorough medical exams and laboratory tests.</p>
          <div style="margin-top: 28px; padding: 20px 24px; background: var(--bg-sunken); border-radius: var(--radius-lg);">
            <p style="font-size: var(--body-sm); font-weight: 600; color: var(--fg-1); margin-bottom: 8px;">Foundation Clinic</p>
            <p style="font-size: var(--body-sm); color: var(--fg-2);">Ratakatu 29 a 4<br>00120 Helsinki, Finland</p>
            <p style="font-size: var(--body-sm); color: var(--fg-2); margin-top: 8px;"><a href="mailto:hello@foundation.clinic" style="color: var(--teal);">hello@foundation.clinic</a></p>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top: 24px;">Contact us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-espresso">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center fade-up" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <h2>Contact us to explore how we can support your long-term health.</h2>
        <p style="margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px;">We answer all emails within 24 hours.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn" style="background: var(--cream); color: var(--espresso);">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>